/T (The Drone Pilots Association of India \(DPAI\) is dedicated to the professional growth of drone pilots and the development of the Indian drone ecosystem. Through continuous improvements, we strive to provide updated knowledge, facilitate skill-building programs, and advocate for the integration of best practices across the industry. )
/E (The Drone Pilots Association of India \(DPAI\) is dedicated to the professional growth of drone pilots and the development of the Indian drone ecosystem. Through continuous improvements, we strive to provide updated knowledge, facilitate skill-building programs, and advocate for the integration of best practices across the industry. )
