/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Chapter 1: Introduction to Drones and Their Role in India Drones, or more accurately referred to as Unmanned Aerial Systems \(UAS\) and Remotely Piloted Aircraft Systems \(RPAS\) in India, have transformed from niche technology to an essential tool across multiple industries. These aerial machines, once restricted to military applications, are now widely used for surveying, agriculture, disaster response, security, and even commercial delivery services. With advancements in automation, artificial intelligence, and regulatory support, India is witnessing a drone revolution that is reshaping the way businesses and government agencies operate.)
/E (Chapter 1: Introduction to Drones and Their Role in India Drones, or more accurately referred to as Unmanned Aerial Systems \(UAS\) and Remotely Piloted Aircraft Systems \(RPAS\) in India, have transformed from niche technology to an essential tool across multiple industries. These aerial machines, once restricted to military applications, are now widely used for surveying, agriculture, disaster response, security, and even commercial delivery services. With advancements in automation, artificial intelligence, and regulatory support, India is witnessing a drone revolution that is reshaping the way businesses and government agencies operate.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
