/E (The Indian government has recognized the potential of drones in modernizing sectors like agriculture, urban planning, and disaster response. Policies now encourage the adoption of drones for tasks such as crop health monitoring, pesticide spraying, land mapping, surveillance & also search-and-rescue operations, significantly improving emergency response times.)
