/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Drones are also becoming indispensable in infrastructure and urban development. Engineers and planners use them for land surveys, 3D mapping, and monitoring construction sites, reducing the time and manpower needed for large-scale projects. In real estate, aerial views captured by drones are helping potential buyers explore properties remotely, adding a new dimension to the industry.)
/E (Drones are also becoming indispensable in infrastructure and urban development. Engineers and planners use them for land surveys, 3D mapping, and monitoring construction sites, reducing the time and manpower needed for large-scale projects. In real estate, aerial views captured by drones are helping potential buyers explore properties remotely, adding a new dimension to the industry.)
