/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Another crucial area where RPAS have proven invaluable is disaster management and emergency response. From assessing flood-affected regions to identifying trapped victims in earthquakes, drones have drastically improved response times in crisis situations. Their ability to access remote and dangerous locations makes them essential tools for humanitarian aid delivery and surveillance in hazardous conditions.)
/E (Another crucial area where RPAS have proven invaluable is disaster management and emergency response. From assessing flood-affected regions to identifying trapped victims in earthquakes, drones have drastically improved response times in crisis situations. Their ability to access remote and dangerous locations makes them essential tools for humanitarian aid delivery and surveillance in hazardous conditions.)
