/S /H1
/T (The Future of Drones in India The future of UAS in India looks incredibly promising, with advancements in 5G connectivity, artificial intelligence, and autonomous navigation set to make drones even more powerful. Companies are already experimenting with drone taxis for urban transport, while e-commerce giants are investing in autonomous delivery drones for last-mile logistics. As the industry matures, opportunities for certified drone pilots, engineers, and entrepreneurs are expected to skyrocket.)
/E (The Future of Drones in India The future of UAS in India looks incredibly promising, with advancements in 5G connectivity, artificial intelligence, and autonomous navigation set to make drones even more powerful. Companies are already experimenting with drone taxis for urban transport, while e-commerce giants are investing in autonomous delivery drones for last-mile logistics. As the industry matures, opportunities for certified drone pilots, engineers, and entrepreneurs are expected to skyrocket.)
