648 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A Type-Certified drone undergoes rigorous evaluation for its design, build quality, safety features, and compliance with Indian regulations. The certification guarantees that a drone is fit for use in various industries, making TC drones a mandatory requirement for most government and enterprise-level operations in India.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
649 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Remote Pilot Certificate \(RPC\) holders must be aware of Type Certification, as it directly impacts their employability and operations. The Government of India mandates the use of TC drones for its projects, ensuring compliance and safety standards. Additionally, private companies increasingly prefer TC drones for commercial projects, making it crucial for pilots to understand their significance.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
650 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Operating TC drones offers several benefits. These drones are more likely to secure insurance and third-party liability coverage, a legal necessity in India. Moreover, financial institutions are more willing to provide loans for purchasing TC drones, reducing the financial burden on pilots and operators. This makes TC drones a valuable investment for commercial drone pilots.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
651 0 obj
<<
