/S /H1
/T (However, pilots should exercise caution when operating TC drones in India. Many TC drones are assembled locally with imported components rather than being fully manufactured in India. This often leads to quality issues in hardware and software, causing reliability concerns. Additionally, serviceability and repairability remain significant challenges, with limited support infrastructure for TC drones. Pilots must critically evaluate the drones they operate to ensure safety, efficiency, and compliance.)
/E (However, pilots should exercise caution when operating TC drones in India. Many TC drones are assembled locally with imported components rather than being fully manufactured in India. This often leads to quality issues in hardware and software, causing reliability concerns. Additionally, serviceability and repairability remain significant challenges, with limited support infrastructure for TC drones. Pilots must critically evaluate the drones they operate to ensure safety, efficiency, and compliance.)
