/S /H1
/T (Scenario 3: Delivering Medical Supplies in Remote Villages Operation: A BVLOS drone is used to deliver vaccines to remote villages. Risk Assessment: Ground Risk: Sparse population reduces ground risk but still requires caution. Air Risk: BVLOS increases risk of losing communication with the drone. Mitigation Measures: Use real-time tracking and redundant communication systems. Create alternate landing zones and emergency protocols.)
/E (Scenario 3: Delivering Medical Supplies in Remote Villages Operation: A BVLOS drone is used to deliver vaccines to remote villages. Risk Assessment: Ground Risk: Sparse population reduces ground risk but still requires caution. Air Risk: BVLOS increases risk of losing communication with the drone. Mitigation Measures: Use real-time tracking and redundant communication systems. Create alternate landing zones and emergency protocols.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [1]
